  },
  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWrite the equation in point–slope form for the line through the point (3, 5) with slope 2.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGraph it on your calculator. Then convert the equation to slope–intercept form. Show that graphs of the two equations are the same.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eRecall the point–slope form of a line.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe point–slope form of a line passing through the point (\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e, \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e) with slope \u003ci\u003em\u003c/i\u003e is:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e – \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e \u003d \u003ci\u003em\u003c/i\u003e(\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSubstitute (3, 5) for (\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e, \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e) and 2 for \u003ci\u003em\u003c/i\u003e to find the equation in point–slope form.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSubstitute (3, 5) for (\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e, \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e) and 2 for \u003ci\u003em\u003c/i\u003e to find the equation in point–slope form.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e – 5 \u003d 2(\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 3)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eRewrite the equation and enter in the calculator.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eRewrite the equation as \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2(\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 3) + 5.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21427\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21427\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and enter the equation for Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e. Key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21428\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21429\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qopenparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21429\u0026quot;,196)\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21430\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21430\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21431\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qminus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21431\u0026quot;,185)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21432\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21433\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcloseparen.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21433\u0026quot;,121)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21434\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qplus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21434\u0026quot;,203)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21435\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_8_90/f-90-8-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert the equation to slope–intercept form.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo convert the equation to slope–intercept form, simplify the right hand side.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2(\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 3) + 5\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 2(3) + 5\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 6 + 5\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 2\u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e – 1\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eEnter the second equation as Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21436\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdown.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21436\u0026quot;,136)\"\u003e and enter the equation for Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21437\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21438\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21438\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21439\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qminus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21439\u0026quot;,185)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21440\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_8_90/f-90-8-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question\"\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eWhat would be an appropriate viewing window for this graph?\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4749\u0027,\u0027yes\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_0\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –10, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4750\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_1\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d –100, Xmax \u003d 100, Xscl \u003d 10, Ymin \u003d –100, Ymax \u003d 100, Yscl \u003d 10\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n \u003cdiv class\u003d\"question_guess\"\u003e\n  \u003cimg onmouseover\u003d\"doQuestionResponse(\u0027rid_4751\u0027,\u0027no\u0027);\" onmouseout\u003d\"doQuestionResponseEnd();\" src\u003d\"/images/tutor5/hint_question-16x16.gif\" name\u003d\"question_2\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\n  \u003cp\u003eXmin \u003d 0, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d 0, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe slope of the line is small.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21441\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qwindow.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21441\u0026quot;,255)\"\u003e and you can set Xmin \u003d –10, Xmax \u003d 10, Xscl \u003d 1, Ymin \u003d –10, Ymax \u003d 10, Yscl \u003d 1.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-11 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_8_90/f-90-8-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21442\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21442\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_21443\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_21443\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e to view the graph.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-13 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_10_1_linearequationsandinequalities_8_90/f-90-8-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
